o every image. A timeless tribute for any dog lover. These wooden signs are ¾\" hick and Predrilled holes to hang portrait or landscape</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmQ3k1YTCU_text","label":"ggmQ3k1YTCU_text","default":"<span style=\"background-color:rgba(20, 56, 92, 0);color:#14385C;\">PET Gift box</span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwxYFkGDtC_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggwxYFkGDtC_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0519/6401/files/Box-Natural-Mockups-pet.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKO60k87v0_text","label":"ggKO60k87v0_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#14385C;\">Need a meaningful gift?<strong> </strong>Just upload a favorite photo of their furry friend and add a short message. We’ll print it onto a beautifully crafted wooden box — sturdy, stylish, and made to last. Fill it with treats, keepsakes, or small surprises, and you’ve got a heartfelt gift that celebrates the bond between pets and the people who love them.</span></p>"}],
